  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration of Irregular Migrants in Turkey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute towards improving Turkey&#x2019;s migration and asylum management in line with the EU standards and best practices. The specific objective of the project is to support the Government of Turkey in the establishment of a comprehensive and sustainable assisted voluntary return and reintegration system.</narrative>
  </description>
